          with the SPDX identifier CC0-1.0, the standard public-domain-equivalent
          id, for tooling purposes; the work is public domain by expiry rather
          than by a rights-holder's CC0 dedication.

The repository asset blitz-task_cpu_zstd/assets/corpus.txt is the plain-text
body of the work only. The Project Gutenberg header and footer (which carry the
Project Gutenberg trademark and license terms for the packaged edition) have
been removed, so nothing but the public-domain text is redistributed. Line
endings are normalized to LF so the corpus is byte-identical on every platform.

